  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved capacity of constituents to promote a gender responsive just energy transition for a safe and healthy working environment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LO will support strengthening fundamental principles and rights at work in mining sector by improved compliance with ILO Conventions Nos. 87 and 98, as well as other Conventions on occupational safety and health (Nos. 155 and 187) and on labour inspection (Nos. 81 and 129); and ii) enhanced capacity of labour inspection along with action plans agreed by the tripartite constituents to foster safe and healthy mining working environments.</narrative>
  </description>
